<Rive version="1" kind="fragment">
<!-- The bus module holds promises every script shares. Waiter, Hatcher and
     Fumbler wait on them from init; Resolver, Spawner and Thrower settle them
     from their first advance, which runs the others' handlers inside their
     own hooks. Hatcher's handler makes and advances an instance of Player;
     Fumbler's throws. Keeper settles its own promises in its own hook.
     Starter's async function plays before and after it awaits ok. -->
